,"wake-up time"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An interview","blocks":[{"type":"iv","intro":"A hotel receptionist talks about polite English.","qa":[["Reporter: How do you start a request?","I say, “**Could you** help me?” or “**Would you mind** waiting?” The voice goes **up** on yes/no questions."],["Reporter: Do guests book by phone?","Many **book** online, but some call. I always ask: “**Which do you prefer**, a double or a single?”"],["Reporter: How do you answer?","“**I prefer** the double **because** it’s bigger.”"]],"gloss":[["request","pedido"],["mind","importar-se"],["double","casal"],["single","individual"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The voice goes up on yes/no questions.","ans":"T","why":"goes up."},{"q":"Guests never book by phone.","ans":"F","why":"some call."},{"q":"One guest prefers the double.","ans":"T","why":"prefer the double."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“request” = ?","opts":["pedido","receita","respeito"],"ans":0,"why":"request."},{"q":"“Would you mind…?” = ?","opts":["Você se importaria de…?","Você gostaria de…?","Você pode ir…?"],"ans":0,"why":"Would you mind."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Polite requests and intonation","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Pedido","Exemplo"],"rows":[["Could you…?","**Could you help me?** ↗"],["Would you mind…?","**Would you mind waiting?** ↗"],["Wh-","**Which do you prefer?** ↘"],["resposta","**I prefer the double because it’s bigger.**"]],"cap":"Polite requests and intonation"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Subida no final = pergunta de sim/não; descida = Wh-. Seja educado com **please** e **thank you**."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"___ you help me? (Could)","a":"Could","why":"pedido."},{"s":"Would you ___ waiting? (mind)","a":"mind","why":"Would you mind + -ing."},{"s":"